bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和之美讽古 其一","author":"司马光","text":"曲逆从汉祖，出奇谁与让。\n一朝寄天下，不及王陵戆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23839,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和之美河洲四诗 其二","author":"司马光","text":"杳杳河洲晚，客行殊未返。\n目随林鸟还，心共征鸿远。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23840,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和之美河洲四诗 其一","author":"司马光","text":"冉冉河洲晓，晴霞登木杪。\n稍见水烟开，孤舟天际小。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23841,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子华过王帅家见梅花盛开呈君实子骏兼简尧夫","author":"司马光","text":"去年与客尽清欢，今日重来立马看。\n犹是携觞同醉在，只愁风雨横相干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23842,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子华游君贶园 其一","author":"司马光","text":"甲第朱门久不开，春风潜入发江梅。\n今朝丞相双车辙，碾破林间水畔苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23843,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和任开叔观福严院旧题名","author":"司马光","text":"墨踪尘淡鬓华新，犹喜重来值故人。\n二十二年如转目，洛阳不改旧时春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23844,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和安之今春于郑国相公及光处得缀珠莲各一本植之盆中仲夏始见一花喜而成咏末句云未知先合谢谁家","author":"司马光","text":"春冻消时种两芽，南风薰日见孤花。\n先开必自陶钧力，且合归功丞相家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23845,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和尧夫先生相招游夏圃","author":"司马光","text":"野迥秋光满，径微朝露寒。\n登高与行远，馀力尚桓桓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23846,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和次道奉慈斋宫见寄","author":"司马光","text":"去住邈如霄与尘，依依欲别更相亲。\n虽知洛邑饶英俊，莫忘斋庐并直人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23847,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君贶老君庙姚黄牡丹","author":"司马光","text":"芳菲触目已萧然，独著金衣奉老仙。\n若占上春先秀发，千花万卉不成妍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23848,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君锡雪后招探春 其一","author":"司马光","text":"莫嫌微雪压梅芽，已有归鸿泊浦沙。\n天上诏来难久驻，直须早看洛阳花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23849,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张伯常贺迁资政","author":"司马光","text":"不驾使车开汉关，不栖岩穴鍊金丹。\n岂无开径三人友，分著垂緌五寸冠。\n坐饱太仓犹自愧，谬跻秘殿益难安。\n愿同野老嬉尧壤，长守先生苜蓿盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23850,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张推官同年春阴无绪偶成 其二","author":"司马光","text":"薄寒未去腊才过，春色先知在绿波。\n不是宿云能作思，大都王粲自情多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23851,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张推官同年春阴无绪偶成 其一","author":"司马光","text":"澹泊轻云寒不收，未成春雨只添愁。\n风烟寂寞几何限，尽入凭高一寸眸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23852,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李君锡惠书及诗勉以早归","author":"司马光","text":"书意勤渠诗意新，清如白雪暖如春。\n西游不尽溪山乐，策马归来就故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23853,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和秉国芙蓉五章 其五","author":"司马光","text":"但见涉江求水际，岂知胜木采霜中。\n微红未肯全衰歇，正似酡颜鹤发翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23854,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]